msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/code/building-linuxcnc.adoc:245
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"build-time dependencies are to be installed, i.e. header files for external "
"code libraries used, as described in the section <<Satisfying-Build-"
