#. type: Labeled list
#: src/code/code-notes.adoc:1374
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "`status.motion.traj.axis_mask`"
msgstr "`status.motion.traj.axis_mask`"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/code/code-notes.adoc:1378
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A bitmask with a \"1\" for the axes that are present and a \"0\" for the "
"axes that are not present.  X is bit 0 with value 2^0^ = 1 if set, Y is bit "
"1 with value 2^1^ = 2, Z is bit 2 with value 4, etc.  For example, a machine "
"with X and Z axes would have an `axis_mask` of 0x5, an XYZ machine would "
"have 0x7, and an XYZB machine would have an `axis_mask` of 0x17."
msgstr ""
"Una máscara de bits con un \"1\" para los ejes que están presentes y un "
"\"0\" para los ejes que no están presentes. X es el bit 0, Y es el bit 1, "
"etc.  Por ejemplo, una máquina con ejes X y Z tendría una `axis_mask` de "
"0x5, una máquina XYZ tendría 0x7, y una máquina XYZB tener un `axis_mask` de "
"0x17."

#. type: Labeled list
#: src/code/code-notes.adoc:1379
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "`status.motion.traj.axes` (removed)"
msgstr "`status.motion.traj.axes` (en desuso)"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/code/code-notes.adoc:1381
msgid ""
"This value was removed in LinuxCNC version 2.9.  Use `axis_mask` instead."
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: src/code/code-notes.adoc:1382
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "`status.motion.traj.joints`"
msgstr "`status.motion.traj.joints`"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/code/code-notes.adoc:1386
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A count of the number of joints the machine has. A normal lathe has 2 "
"joints; one driving the X axis and one driving the Z axis.  An XYYZ gantry "
"mill has 4 joints: one driving X, one driving one side of the Y, one driving "
"the other side of the Y, and one driving Z.  An XYZA mill also has 4 joints."
msgstr ""
"Un recuento del número de juntas que tiene la máquina. Un torno normal tiene "
"2 articulaciones; uno manejando el eje X y otro manejando el eje Z.  Un "
"molino de pórtico XYYZ tiene 4 articulaciones; uno manejando X, uno "
"manejando un lado de la Y, uno manejando el otro lado de la Y, y uno "
"manejando Z.  Un molino XYZA también tiene 4 articulaciones."

#. type: Labeled list
#: src/code/code-notes.adoc:1387
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "`status.motion.axis[EMCMOT_MAX_AXIS]`"
msgstr "`status.motion.axis [EMCMOT_MAX_AXIS]`"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/code/code-notes.adoc:1390
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"An array of `EMCMOT_MAX_AXIS` axis structures. `axis[n]` is valid if "
"`(axis_mask & (1 << n))` is True.  If `(axis_mask & (1 << n))` is False, "
"then `axis[n]` does not exist on this machine and must be ignored."
msgstr ""
"Una matriz de estructuras de eje `EMCMOT_MAX_AXIS`. `axis [n]` es válido si "
"`(axis_mask & (1 << n))` es True. Si `(axis_mask & (1 << n))` es Falso, "
"entonces `axis [n]` no existe en esta máquina y debe ser ignorado."

#. type: Labeled list
#: src/code/code-notes.adoc:1391
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "`status.motion.joint[EMCMOT_MAX_JOINTS]`"
msgstr "`status.motion.joint [EMCMOT_MAX_JOINTS]`"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/code/code-notes.adoc:1394
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"An array of `EMCMOT_MAX_JOINTS` joint structures.  `joint[0]` through "
"`joint[joints-1]` are valid, the others do not exist on this machine and "
"must be ignored."
msgstr ""
"Una matriz de estructuras de unión `EMCMOT_MAX_JOINTS`. `conjunta [0]` a "
"través `joint [joint-1]` son válidas, las otras no existen en esta máquina y "
"debe ser ignorado."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/code/code-notes.adoc:1398
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Things are not this way currently in the joints-axes branch, but deviations "
"from this design are considered bugs.  For an example of such a bug, see the "
"treatment of axes in src/emc/ini/initraj.cc:loadTraj().  There are "
