msgstr ""
"'One / Two Parport' - Select how many parallel port are to be configured."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/config/stepconf.adoc:101
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"'Base Period Maximum Jitter' - (((Base Period Maximum Jitter)))  Enter the "
"result of the Latency Test here.  To run a latency test press the 'Test Base "
