#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "For more information"
msgstr "Informacion de herramient"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/drivers/pluto-p.adoc:109
msgid ""
"Some additional information about it is available from https://www.knjn.com/"
"FPGA-Parallel.html[KNJC LLC] and from http://emergent.unpy."
"net/01165081407[the developer's blog]."
