#. type: Plain text
#: src/gcode/coordinates.adoc:407
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This sample engraving project mills a set of four .1 radius circles in "
"roughly a star shape around a center circle. We can setup the individual "
"circle pattern like this."
msgstr ""
