"'M7' - activa el refrigerante de niebla. M7 controla el pin iocontrol.0."
"coolant-mist."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gcode/m-code.adoc:198
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"'M8' - turn flood coolant on. M8 controls iocontrol.0.coolant-flood pin."
