"código G de movimiento (G0, G1, etc.) justo después de M67. Las funciones "
"M67 son las mismas que las de M62-63."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gcode/m-code.adoc:447
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"M67 will not function unless the appropriate motion.analog-out-_nn_ pins are "
"connected in your HAL file to outputs."
msgstr ""
"M67 no funcionará a menos que los pines motion.analog-out-nn apropiados sean "
"conectado en su archivo hal a las salidas."

#. type: Title ==
#: src/gcode/m-code.adoc:449
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "M68 Analog Output, Immediate(((M68 Analog Output)))"
msgstr "M68 Salida analógica, inmediata(((M68 Analog Output)))"

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/gcode/m-code.adoc:454
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "M68 E- Q-\n"
msgstr "M68 E- Q-\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gcode/m-code.adoc:457
#, fuzzy
msgid "'M68' - set an analog output immediately."
msgstr "'M68' - establece una salida analógica de inmediato."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gcode/m-code.adoc:458
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"'E-' - output number ranging from 0 to 3. (Adjustable from motmod argument "
"num_aio)"
msgstr "'E-' - número de salida que va de 0 a 3."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gcode/m-code.adoc:463
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"M68 output happen immediately as they are received by the motion controller. "
"They are not synchronized with movement, and they will break blending. M68 "
"functions the same as M64-65."
msgstr ""
