"en 'endsub' o cualquier ruta de 'retorno', programe 'M73'."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gcode/m-code.adoc:596
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Aborting a running program in a subroutine which has an 'M73' operation will "
"*not* restore state ."
