"tool management are prefixed with *iocontrol.0.*"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gcode/tool-compensation.adoc:151
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A G-code *T* command asserts the HAL output pin `iocontrol.0.tool-prepare`.  "
"The HAL input pin, `iocontrol.0.tool-prepared`, must be set by external HAL "
