#. type: Plain text
#: src/getting-started/getting-linuxcnc.adoc:140
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Use the `dd` command to write the image to your USB storage device.  For "
"example, if your storage device showed up as `/dev/sde`, then use this "
"command:"
msgstr ""
