#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Alternate Install Methods"
msgstr "not Funciones"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/getting-started/getting-linuxcnc.adoc:246
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The easiest, preferred way to install LinuxCNC is to use the Live/Install "
"Image as described above.  That method is as simple and reliable as we can "
"make it, and is suitable for novice users and experienced users alike.  "
"However, this will typically replace any existing operating system.  If you "
"have files on the target PC that you want to keep, then use one of the "
"methods described in this section."
msgstr ""
"La manera más fácil y preferida de instalar LinuxCNC es usar la imagen Live/"
"Install tal como se ha descrito arriba. Ese método es tan simple y confiable "
"como ha sido posible, y es adecuado tanto para usuarios principiantes como "
"para usuarios experimentados.  Sin embargo, esto normalmente reemplazará "
"cualquier sistema operativo existente, aunque hay formas de conservar el "
"sistema preexistente y coexistir con el nuevo."

