#: src/getting-started/updating-linuxcnc.adoc:40
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Furthermore, if you are running Ubuntu Precise or Debian Wheezy it is well "
"worth considering making a backup of the \"linuxcnc\" directory on removable "
