msgid ""
"The [TOOL_CHANGE] Z position should be high enough so the tool will not hit "
"the tool probe when moving to the [VERSA_TOOLSETTER] X and Y position.  "
"MAXPROBE distance needs to be high enough for the tool to touch the probe."
