#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-vismach.adoc:311 src/gui/vismach.adoc:183
#, fuzzy
msgid "Create the spindle at the origin."
msgstr "Reinicia el husillo en la dirección en la que iba."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-vismach.adoc:312 src/gui/vismach.adoc:184
msgid "Define the rotation."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-vismach.adoc:313 src/gui/vismach.adoc:185
msgid "Move the head to the spindle or spindle to the head."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-vismach.adoc:314 src/gui/vismach.adoc:186
#, fuzzy
msgid "Create the draw bar."
msgstr "Crear pines y parámetros"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-vismach.adoc:315 src/gui/vismach.adoc:187
msgid "Define the motion of the draw bar."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-vismach.adoc:316 src/gui/vismach.adoc:188
msgid "Assemble the three parts into a head assembly."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-vismach.adoc:317 src/gui/vismach.adoc:189
msgid "Define the motion of the head assembly."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-vismach.adoc:319 src/gui/vismach.adoc:192
msgid ""
"In this example the spindle rotation is indicated by rotation of a set of "
"drive dogs:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/gui/qtvcp-vismach.adoc:327 src/gui/vismach.adoc:200
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"#Drive dogs\n"
"dogs = Box(-6,-3,94,6,3,100)\n"
"dogs = Color([1,1,1,1],[dogs])\n"
"dogs = HalRotate([dogs],c,\"spindle\",360,0,0,1)\n"
"dogs = Translate([dogs],-1,49,0)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/gui/qtvcp-vismach.adoc:333 src/gui/vismach.adoc:206
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"#Drawbar\n"
"draw = CylinderZ(120,3,125,3)\n"
"draw = Color([1,0,.5,1],[draw])\n"
"draw = Translate([draw],-1,49,0)\n"
"draw = HalTranslate([draw],c,\"drawbar\",0,0,1)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/gui/qtvcp-vismach.adoc:340 src/gui/vismach.adoc:213
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# head/spindle\n"
"head = AsciiSTL(filename=\"./head.stl\")\n"
"head = Color([0.3,0.3,0.3,1],[head])\n"
"head = Translate([head],0,0,4)\n"
"head = Collection([head, tool, dogs, draw])\n"
"head = HalTranslate([head],c,\"Z\",0,0,0.1)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/gui/qtvcp-vismach.adoc:346 src/gui/vismach.adoc:219
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# base\n"
"base = AsciiSTL(filename=\"./base.stl\")\n"
"base = Color([0.5,0.5,0.5,1],[base])\n"
"# mount head on it\n"
"base = Collection([head, base])\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-vismach.adoc:349
msgid ""
"Finally a *single collection of all the machine parts, floor and work* (if "
"any) needs to be created."
