#. type: Title ===
#: src/hal/basic-hal.adoc:179
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "setp(((HAL setp,setp)))"
msgstr "setp(((HAL setp,setp)))"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/hal/basic-hal.adoc:184
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The command `setp` sets the value of a pin or parameter.  The valid values "
"will depend on the type of the pin or parameter.  It is an error if the data "
"types do not match."
msgstr ""
"El comando 'setp' establece el valor de un pin o parámetro.  Los valores "
"validos dependerán del tipo de pin o parámetro. Es un error si los tipos de "
"datos no coinciden."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/hal/basic-hal.adoc:188
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Some components have parameters that need to be set before use.  Parameters "
"can be set before use or while running as needed.  You cannot use setp on a "
"pin that is connected to a signal."
msgstr ""
"Algunos componentes tienen parámetros que deben establecerse antes de su "
