#. type: Title ===
#: src/hal/basic-hal.adoc:510
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "weighted_sum(((HAL weighted_sum,weighted_sum)))"
msgstr "weighted_sum(((HAL weighted_sum,weighted_sum)))"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/hal/basic-hal.adoc:516
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The weighted sum converts a group of bits into an integer.  The conversion "
"is the sum of the 'weights' of the bits present plus any offset.  It's "
"similar to 'binary coded decimal' but with more options.  The 'hold' bit "
"interrupts the input processing, so that the 'sum' value no longer changes."
msgstr ""
"'weighted_sum' convierte un grupo de bits en un entero. La conversión es la "
"suma de los \"pesos\" de los bits que valen 1, mas cualquier offset. El peso "
"del bit m-ésimo es 2^m. Esto es similar a un binario codificado en decimal "
"pero con más opciones. El bit 'hold' (retención) detiene el procesamiento; "
"si la entrada cambia, la 'suma' no cambia."

#. type: Block title
#: src/hal/basic-hal.adoc:517
#, no-wrap
msgid "Syntax for loading component `weighted_sum`"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/hal/basic-hal.adoc:521
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "loadrt weighted_sum wsum_sizes=size[,size,...]\n"
msgstr "loadrt weighted_sum wsum_sizes=tamaño[,tamaño,...]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/hal/basic-hal.adoc:524
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Creates groups of ``weighted_sum``s, each with the given number of input "
"bits (size)."
msgstr ""
"Crea grupos de suma ponderada, cada uno con la cantidad dada de bits de "
"entrada (size)."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/hal/basic-hal.adoc:526
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To update the `weighted_sum`, the `process_wsums` must be attached to a "
"thread."
msgstr ""
"Para actualizar 'weighted_sum' se necesita adjuntar la funcion "
"'process_wsums' a un hilo."

#. type: Block title
#: src/hal/basic-hal.adoc:527
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Add `process_wsums` to servo thread"
msgstr "addf process_wsums servo-thread\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/hal/basic-hal.adoc:531
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "addf process_wsums servo-thread\n"
msgstr "addf process_wsums servo-thread\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/hal/basic-hal.adoc:534
#, fuzzy
msgid "Which updates the `weighted_sum` component."
msgstr "Esta funcion actualiza el componente weighted_sum."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/hal/basic-hal.adoc:537
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In the following example, a copy of the AXIS HAL configuration window, bits "
"'0' and '2' are TRUE, they have no offset.  The weight ('weight') of bit 0 "
"is 1, that of bit 2 is 4, so the sum is 5."
msgstr ""
"En el siguiente ejemplo, recortado de la ventana HAL Configuration en Axis, "
"Los bits '0' y '2' son verdaderos y no hay offset. El 'peso' del bit 0 es 1 "
"y el 'peso' del bit 2 es 4, por lo que la suma es 5."

