#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The special position Lead.\n"
"*Continuous:* In this mode jogging is performed at the selected feed rate. As long the jogwheel turns, the selected axis moves.\n"
"*Step:* In this mode the machine moves steps * wheel_counts at the currently selected step size and the current set feed rate in machine units. If the commanded position is not reached the machine keeps moving even the jogwheel is not turning.\n"
"*Lead:* Manipulates the spindle override.\n"
"*MPG:* Manipulates the feedrate override."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/man/man1/xhc-whb04b-6.1.adoc:210
msgid ""
