"rotary button back from Lead revert to MPG mode, MPG mode is default mode at "
"startup.  Depending on the mode before turning the rotary button, the feed "
"override results in different values.  In MPG/CON the feed rate will change "
"to 100%, 60%, ... and so forth. In Step mode the feed rate is specified in "
"mm."
