#. type: Plain text
#: src/man/man3/hm2_tram_add_bspi_frame.3hm2.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*hm2_tram_add_bspi_frame* Add a regular (every thread) write event to\n"
"the Hostmot2 tram for bspi instance \"name\". \"name\" is a unique string\n"
"given to each bspi channel during hostmot2 setup. The names of the\n"
"available channels are printed to standard output during the driver\n"
"loading process and take the form: hm2_<board name>.<board\n"
"index>.bspi.<index> For example hm2_5i23.0.bspi.0\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/man/man3/hm2_tram_add_bspi_frame.3hm2.adoc:29
msgid ""
