#. type: Plain text
#: src/man/man3/hm2_uart_setup.3hm2.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*hm2_uart_setup* Setup the bitrate for the UART named \"name\".\n"
"\"name\" is a unique string given to each UART during hostmot2 setup.\n"
"The names of the available UARTs are printed to standard output during the driver\n"
"loading process and take the form: hm2___<board name>__.__<board index>__.uart.__<index>__,\n"
"for example `hm2_5i23.0.uart.0`.\n"
"The minimum bitrate is approximately 50 bps, and the maximum around the FPGA frequency, 48 MHz for a 5I23.\n"
"The UART function allows different RX and TX bitrates, but that is not currently supported by this driver\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/man/man3/hm2_uart_setup.3hm2.adoc:26
msgid "tx_mode is bit mask defined in the Hostmot2 regmap:"
