#. type: Plain text
#: src/man/man9/debounce.9.adoc:10
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "**loadrt debounce cfg=**__size__[,__size__,...]\n"
msgstr "loadrt weighted_sum wsum_sizes=tamaño[,tamaño,...]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/man/man9/debounce.9.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Creates debounce groups with the number of filters specified by (_size_). "
"Every filter in the same group has the same sample rate and delay. For "
"example cfg=2,3 creates two filter groups with 2 filters in the first group "
"and 3 filters in the second group."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/man/man9/debounce.9.adoc:22
msgid ""
"An alternate component named *dbounce* implements similar functionality "
"using conventional count= and names= parameters. Delay settings are "
"implemented by a delay pin for each instance instead of using filter groups."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/man/man9/debounce.9.adoc:34
msgid ""
"The debounce filter works by incrementing a counter whenever the input is "
"true, and decrementing the counter when it is false. If the counter "
"decrements to zero, the output is set false and the counter ignores further "
"decrements. If the counter increments up to a threshold, the output is set "
"true and the counter ignores further increments. If the counter is between "
"zero and the threshold, the output retains its previous state. The threshold "
"determines the amount of filtering: A threshold of 1 does no filtering at "
"all, and a threshold of _N_ requires a signal to be present for _N_ samples "
"before the output changes state."
msgstr ""

