msgstr "'lut5' no requiere un hilo de punto flotante."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/man/man9/hostmot2.9.adoc:684
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When this pin is set high the position and counts pins will be reset\n"
"the next time the resolver passes through the zero position. At the\n"
"same time the pin is driven low to indicate to connected modules that\n"
"the index has been seen, and that the counters have been reset.\n"
msgstr ""

