#. type: Plain text
#: src/man/man9/sampler.9.adoc:6
#, fuzzy
msgid "sampler - sample data from HAL in real time"
msgstr "(((sampler))) Muestrea datos HAL en tiempo real."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/man/man9/sampler.9.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "*loadrt sampler* **depth=**_depth1_[,_depth2_...] **cfg=**_string1_[,_string2_...]\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/man/man9/sampler.9.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*sampler* and **halsampler**(1) are used together to sample HAL data in\n"
"real time and store it in a file. *sampler* is a realtime HAL component\n"
"that exports HAL pins and creates a FIFO in shared memory. It then\n"
"begins sampling data from the HAL and storing it to the FIFO.\n"
"*halsampler* is a non-realtime program that copies data from the FIFO to\n"
"stdout, where it can be redirected to a file or piped to some other\n"
"program.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: src/man/man9/sampler.9.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "*depth=*_depth1_[,_depth2_...]"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/man/man9/sampler.9.adoc:29
msgid ""
"sets the depth of the realtime->non-realtime FIFO that *sampler* creates to "
"buffer the realtime data. Multiple values of _depth_ (separated by commas) "
"can be specified if you need more than one FIFO (for example if you want to "
"sample data from two different realtime threads)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: src/man/man9/sampler.9.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "*cfg=*_string1_[,_string2_...]"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/man/man9/sampler.9.adoc:34
msgid ""
"defines the set of HAL pins that *sampler* exports and later samples data "
"from. One _string_ must be supplied for each FIFO, separated by commas. "
"*sampler* exports one pin for each character in _string._ Legal characters "
"are:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/man/man9/sampler.9.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"::\n"
"  *F, f* (float pin)\n"
"::\n"
"  *B, b* (bit pin)\n"
"::\n"
"  *S, s* (s32 pin)\n"
"::\n"
"  *U, u* (u32 pin)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: src/man/man9/sampler.9.adoc:46
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "*sampler.*_N_"
msgstr "sampler"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/man/man9/sampler.9.adoc:48 src/man/man9/streamer.9.adoc:37
msgid "One function is created per FIFO, numbered from zero."
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
