"Since *supply* was written, the *setp* command has been modified to allow it "
"to set unconnected pins as well as parameters. In addition, the *sets* "
"command was added, which can directly set HAL signals, as long as there are "
"no output pins connected to them. Therefore, *supply* is obsolete."
