#. type: Plain text
#: src/man/man9/supply.9.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*supply* supports a maximum of eight channels. The number of channels\n"
"actually loaded is set by the *num_chan* argument when the module is\n"
"loaded. If *numchan* is not specified, the default value is one.\n"
