"Los ejemplos de configuraciones de simulación de xyzac-trt y xyzbc-trt en "
"las estan en Configuraciones de Ejemplo ('configs/sim/axis/vismach/5axis/"
"table-rotary-tilting/')."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/motion/5-axis-kinematics.adoc:301
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The example configurations include the required INI files and an examples "
"subdirectory with G-code (NGC) files. These sim configurations invoke a "
"realistic 3-dimensional model using the LinuxCNC vismach facility."
