#. type: Title ==
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:2566
#, no-wrap
msgid "Conversational Shape Library"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:2572
msgid ""
"The *Conversational Shape Library* consists of several basic shapes and "
"functions to assist the user with generating quick G-code at the machine to "
"cut simple shapes quickly.  This feature is found on the <<plasma:"
"conversational-tab,CONVERSATIONAL Tab>>."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:2575
msgid ""
"The Conversational Library is not meant to be a CAD/CAM replacement as there "
"are limitations to what can be achieved."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:2577
msgid ""
"Blank entries in the shape input boxes will use the current setting at the "
"time the G-code was generated. For example, if *X start* was left blank then "
"the current X axis position would be used."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:2579
msgid "All leadins and leadouts are arcs except for *Circles* and *Stars*:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:2581
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Circles:*\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:2583
msgid "If the circle is external then any leadin or leadout will be an arc."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:2584
msgid ""
"If the circle is internal and a *small hole* then any leadin will be "
"perpendicular and there will be no lead out."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:2587
msgid ""
"If the circle is internal and not a *small hole* then any leadin and leadout "
"will be an arc.  If the leadin has a length greater than half the radius "
"then the leadin will revert to perpendicular and there will be no leadout.  "
"If the leadout has a length greater than half the radius then there will be "
"no leadout."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:2589
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Stars:*\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:2591
msgid ""
"The leadin is at the same angle as the first cut and the leadout is at the "
"same angle as the last cut."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:2593
msgid ""
"A *small hole* is a circle that is smaller than the SMALL HOLE DIAMETER "
"specified in the CONVERSATIONAL SETTINGS page."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:2595
msgid "The holes in a BOLT CIRCLE shape will also abide by the above rules."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:2597
#, no-wrap
msgid "*The cut order will occur in the same order as the shape was built.*\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:2600
msgid ""
"Pressing *Return* on the keyboard while editing parameters will "
"automatically show the preview of the shape if there are enough parameters "
"entered to create the shape.  Clicking any of the available check boxes will "
"do the same."
msgstr ""

