#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:2802
msgid ""
"All errors are logged into the machine log which is able to be viewed in the "
"<<plasma:statistics-tab,STATISTICS Tab>>.  The log file is saved into the "
"configuration directory when QtPlasmaC is shutdown.  The five last logfiles "
"are kept, after which the oldest logfile is deleted each time a new log file "
"is created.  These saved log files may be viewed with any text editor."
