#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:3330
msgid ""
"The following commands must be a single command per user button, and the "
"button code must start with the special command. The exception is <<plasma:"
"button-laser,toggle-laser>> which may be appear anywhere in the code as "
"demonstrated below."
