#. type: Title ===
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:3973
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hypertherm PowerMax Communications"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:3978
msgid ""
"Communications can be established with a Hypertherm PowerMax plasma cutter "
"that has a RS485 port.  This feature enables the setting of *Cut Mode*, "
"*Cutting Amperage* and *Gas Pressure* automatically from the *Cut "
"Parameters* of the material file.  In addition, the user will be able to "
"view the PowerMax's *Arc On Time* in hh:mm:ss format on the <<plasma:"
"statistics-tab,STATISTICS Tab>>."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:3980
msgid ""
"If *Gas Pressure* is set to zero, then the PowerMax will automatically "
"calculate the required pressure from the *Cut Mode*, *Cut Current*, torch "
"type, and torch length."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:3982
msgid ""
"Changing the cutting mode will set the gas pressure to zero causing the "
"machine to use its automatic gas pressure mode."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:3985
msgid ""
"The maximum and minimum values of these parameters are read from the plasma "
"cutter and the related spin-buttons in the Cut Parameters are then limited "
"by these values.  Gas pressure cannot be changed from zero until "
"communications have been established."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:3988
msgid ""
"This feature is enabled by setting the correct port name for the PM_PORT "
"option in the *[POWERMAX]* section of the _<machine_name>_.prefs file.  If "
"the PM_PORT option is not set in the _<machine_name>_.prefs file then the "
"widgets associated with this feature will not be visible."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:3990
msgid ""
"Example showing enabling the Hypertherm PowerMax Communications on USB0:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:3995
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[POWERMAX]\n"
"Port = /dev/ttyusb0\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:3999
msgid ""
"If the user is unsure of the name of the port, there is a Python script in "
"the configuration directory that will show all available ports and can also "
"be used to test communications with the plasma unit prior to enabling this "
"feature in the QtPlasmaC GUI."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:4001
msgid "To use the test script, follow these instructions:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:4005
#, no-wrap
msgid "pmx485-test\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:4011
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"source ~/linuxcnc-dev/scripts/rip-environment\n"
"pmx485-test\n"
msgstr ""
"> source ../scripts/rip-environment\n"
"> runtests\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:4015
msgid ""
"The gas pressure units display (psi or bar) is determined by the data "
"received during initial setup of the communication link and is then shown "
"next to the Gas Pressure setting in the MATERIAL section of the <<plasma:"
"parameters-tab,PARAMETERS Tab>>."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:4018
msgid ""
"The PowerMax machine will go into remote mode after communications have been "
"established and may only be controlled remotely (via the QtPlasmaC GUI) at "
"this point.  The connection can be validated by observing the PowerMax "
"display."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:4020
msgid "To switch the PowerMax back to local mode the user can either:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:4022
msgid "Disable PowerMax Comms from the <<plasma:main-tab, MAIN Tab>>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:4023
msgid ""
"Close LinuxCNC which will put the PowerMax into local mode during shutdown."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:4024
msgid "Turn the PowerMax off for 30 seconds and then power it back on."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:4026
msgid ""
"If PowerMax communications is active then selecting <<plasma:mesh-mode,Mesh "
"Mode>> will automatically select CPA mode on the PowerMax unit."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:4030
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To use the PowerMax communications feature it is necessary to have the Python pyserial module installed.\n"
"If pyserial is not installed an error message will be displayed."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:4032
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To install pyserial, enter the following command into a terminal window:"
msgstr ""
"Para abrir una página del manual utilice una terminal. La terminal se puede "
"abrir usando la ruta 'Applications > Accessories > Terminal'. Por ejemplo si "
"quiere encontrar algo acerca del comando de busqueda \"find\" tecle:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:4034
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "sudo apt install python3-serial\n"
msgstr "sudo apt install mesaflash\n"

