#. type: Title ====
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:4075
#, no-wrap
msgid "Wiggle Pierce"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:4078
msgid ""
"The model supported is the same as that created by Sheetcam's wiggle pierce. "
"Given a straight leadin to the main cut the wiggle pierce is expected to "
"move back and forth for some distance along the leadin. Strictly speaking "
"this straight movement is arbitrary. Technically any X/Y motion is available "
"during the pierce delay, and it is up the CAM tooling or the user to program."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:4080
msgid ""
"The constraint is that this motion is expected to be completed during the "
"pierce delay value. If not then the torch will transition to normal cut "
"height on completion of pierce delay and potentially before the wiggle "
"motion is completed."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:4082
msgid ""
"Therefore, the length of the wiggle and the feedrate need to be considered "
"in calculating the pierce delay, or the size of the wiggle constrained based "
"on feedrate and pierce delay."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:4086
msgid "A feed rate of 1080 mm/min (18 mm/s)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:4087
msgid "A wiggle movement of 4mm for 3 oscillations"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:4089
msgid ""
"This means that the length of the wiggle is 4 x 3 = 12mm. At the 18 mm/s "
"feedrate, the pierce delay needs to be approx 0.7 seconds to support the "
"wiggle distance at pierce height."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:4091
msgid "The G-code needed invoke this behaviour is: +"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:4094
#, no-wrap
msgid "M159 P601 Q1\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:4097
msgid "The G-code needed to reset to standard behaviour is: +"
msgstr ""

