#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:4498
msgid ""
"PnCconf has entries for all required THCAD parameters and will calculate and "
"configure any required settings.  The calculations used are as follows:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:4503
#, no-wrap
msgid "vs = r / ((f - z) / d / v)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:4509
#, no-wrap
msgid "vo = z / d\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:4512
msgid "_r_ = divider ratio (see below)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:4514
msgid "_f_ = full scale value from calibration sticker."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:4516
msgid "_z_ = 0 V value from calibration sticker."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:4518
msgid "_d_ = value from jumper above."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:4520
msgid "_v_ = full scale voltage of THCAD"
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:4521
#, no-wrap
msgid "Divider Ratio"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:4524
msgid "_THCAD-5 or THCAD-10_"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:4526
msgid ""
"If connecting to a plasma CNC port, then the divider ratio is selected from "
"the plasma machine. A common ratio used is 20:1."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:4530
msgid ""
"If connecting to the plasma machines full arc voltage, then a common setup "
"for a THCAD-10 is to use a 1 MΩ resistor from arc negative to THCAD negative "
"and a 1 MΩ resistor from arc positive to THCAD positive.  The divider ratio "
"is obtained by:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:4533
#, no-wrap
msgid "r = (total_resistance + 100000) / 100000\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:4536
msgid "_THCAD-300_"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:4539
#, no-wrap
msgid "r = 1\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:4542
msgid ""
"IF THE USER IS USING A HF START PLASMA POWER SUPPLY, THEN EACH OF THESE "
"RESISTANCES SHOULD BE MADE UP OF SEVERAL HIGH VOLTAGE RESISTORS."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:4544
msgid ""
"IF THE USER IS USING A HF START PLASMA POWER SUPPLY, THEN OHMIC SENSING IS "
"NOT RECOMMENDED."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:4547
msgid ""
"These values can be calculated by using https://jscalc.io/calc/"
"NTr5QDX6WgMThBVb[this online calculator]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:4550
msgid ""
"There is a <<plasma:lowpass,lowpass filter>> available which may be useful "
"if using a THCAD and there is a lot of noise on the returned arc voltage."
msgstr ""

