"argumento diccionario de palabras clave. Úselo para no tener que investigar "
"las palabras pasadas en el bloque por usted mismo."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/remap/remap.adoc:324
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Note that if all you want to achieve is to call some Python code from G-"
"code, there is the somewhat easier way of <<remap:python-o-word-procs,"
