msgid ""
"The pocket to move to when the .enable pin goes high. If the value passed is "
"higher than the number of pockets specified in the \"pockets\" modparam then "
"modulo arithmetic is used. This is intended to allow the use of multiple "
"tools in the same holder, as is sometimes useful with lathes."
