#. type: TH
#: man/man9/charge_pump.9:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "CHARGE_PUMP"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/charge_pump.9:13
msgid ""
"charge_pump - Create a square-wave for the 'charge pump' input of some "
"controller boards"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/charge_pump.9:16
#, fuzzy
msgid "B<loadrt charge_pump>"
msgstr "charge_pump"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/charge_pump.9:25
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The 'Charge Pump' should be added to the base thread function.  When enabled "
"the output is on for one period and off for one period. To calculate the "
"frequency of the output 1/(period time in seconds x 2) = Hz. For example if "
"you have a base period of 100,000ns that is 0.0001 seconds and the formula "
"would be 1/(0.0001 x 2) = 5,000 Hz or 5 kHz. Two additional outputs are "
"provided that run a factor of 2 and 4 slower for hardware that requires a "
"lower frequency."
msgstr ""
"(((charge_pump))) Crea una onda cuadrada para la entrada de 'bomba de carga' "
"de algunas placas controladoras.  La 'bomba de carga' debe agregarse a la "
"función hilo base.  Cuando está habilitada, la salida está activada durante "
"un período y desactivada durante otro.  Para calcular la frecuencia de la "
"salida 1/(período de tiempo en segundos x 2) = hz.  Por ejemplo, si tiene un "
"período base de 100.000 ns, o 0,0001 segundos, la fórmula sería 1/(0,0001 x "
"2) = 5000 hz o 5 Khz."

#. type: TP
#: man/man9/charge_pump.9:26
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "B<charge-pump>"
msgstr "charge_pump"

#. type: Plain text
