#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/estop_latch.9:78
msgid ""
"Typically, an external fault or estop input is connected to B<fault-in>, "
"B<iocontrol.0.user-request-enable> is connected to B<reset>, and B<ok-out> "
"is connected to B<iocontrol.0.emc-enable-in.>"
